{"id":"70f515f00e5dc348","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-indiscernibles-in-L.md","title":"Indiscernibles in L","display":"thm-indiscernibles-in-L — Indiscernibles in L","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-indiscernibles-in-L","aliases":["58-thm-indiscernibles-in-L","Indiscernibles in L","Silver Indiscernibles Theory"],"display":"thm-indiscernibles-in-L — Indiscernibles in L","depends_on":["[[58-thm-silver-indiscernibles]]","[[58-thm-0-sharp]]","[[58-df-constructible-universe]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-indiscernibles-in-L"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-indiscernibles-in-L</span><span>Indiscernibles in L</span><span>Silver Indiscernibles Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-indiscernibles-in-L — Indiscernibles in L"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e04cbefb6776d1b\" href=\"?note=4e04cbefb6776d1b\" title=\"58-thm-silver-indiscernibles\">58-thm-silver-indiscernibles</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16b215b0ea9d456b\" href=\"?note=16b215b0ea9d456b\" title=\"58-thm-0-sharp\">58-thm-0-sharp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (constructible universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (class of ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> (metalinguistic domain of class quantification)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> (metatheoretic derivability marker)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperClass}(I)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperClass}(I)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}(I,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}(I,L)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e04cbefb6776d1b\" href=\"?note=4e04cbefb6776d1b\" title=\"58-thm-silver-indiscernibles\">58-thm-silver-indiscernibles</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\">\\(\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"16b215b0ea9d456b\" href=\"?note=16b215b0ea9d456b\" title=\"58-thm-0-sharp\">58-thm-0-sharp</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indiscernibles\\text{-}in\\text{-}L}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\leftrightarrow\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ProperClass}(I)\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}(I,L)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indiscernibles\\text{-}in\\text{-}L}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\leftrightarrow\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ProperClass}(I)\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}(I,L)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Silver: discovered indiscernibles in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^\\sharp\">\\(0^\\sharp\\)</span>: theory of indiscernibles.</li>\n<li>Generate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>: Skolem hull.</li>\n<li>Embeddings: shift indiscernibles.</li>\n<li>When indiscernibles exist, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is generated as the Skolem hull of the indiscernible sequence.</li>\n<li>Applications: inner model theory.</li>\n<li>Foundation: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> analysis beyond <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V = L\">\\(V = L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The equivalence is metatheoretic because it quantifies over a proper class of indiscernibles.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-thm-silver-indiscernibles","status":"resolved","id":"4e04cbefb6776d1b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-silver-indiscernibles]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-0-sharp","status":"resolved","id":"16b215b0ea9d456b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible-universe","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-constructible-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible-universe","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (constructible universe, see [[58-df-constructible-universe]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-silver-indiscernibles","status":"resolved","id":"4e04cbefb6776d1b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperClass}(I)$ and $\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}(I,L)$ (see [[58-thm-silver-indiscernibles]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-0-sharp","status":"resolved","id":"16b215b0ea9d456b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)$ (see [[58-thm-0-sharp]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{meta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperClass}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}(I,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indiscernibles\\text{-}in\\text{-}L}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\leftrightarrow\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ProperClass}(I)\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}(I,L)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"0^\\sharp","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"V = L","display":false}],"bytes":1552,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-indiscernibles-in-L.md|58-thm-indiscernibles-in-L]]（batch12）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-car